{"steam_appid":2475460,"steam_name":"SOS OPS!","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2475460/839976204/b11df7051ed0b9a36ec17acff80954206309dd6e/1790371812/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791094098","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257435448/55d35b9e229e95447b8356b2d3a126747d6c4244/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791094098","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/99d1f93eca12349c8f44bd0636e3b294643a366b/ss_99d1f93eca12349c8f44bd0636e3b294643a366b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/efd67f52bc97b090cc3a4673dc4ffaa2e3aba1f1/ss_efd67f52bc97b090cc3a4673dc4ffaa2e3aba1f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/6386fdd9ceb5eeab879bda5b5c7dd4e53082c1a0/ss_6386fdd9ceb5eeab879bda5b5c7dd4e53082c1a0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/c049fc3e0a28917aa72237b3275e4cc0784b136d/ss_c049fc3e0a28917aa72237b3275e4cc0784b136d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/c1431e3d1f9ee8ec7261ff30be6b347e0391dffa/ss_c1431e3d1f9ee8ec7261ff30be6b347e0391dffa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791094099"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/4259b8f47e095c118168131fef72f0c2.poster.avif?t=1791094099\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/4259b8f47e095c118168131fef72f0c2.webm?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/4259b8f47e095c118168131fef72f0c2.mp4?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SOS OPS!</strong> is a co-op chaos game about saving a city, where you and your friends turn every mission into absolute madness.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/39c1bed6aa69a2c29aeb299db9df7585.poster.avif?t=1791094099\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/39c1bed6aa69a2c29aeb299db9df7585.webm?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/39c1bed6aa69a2c29aeb299db9df7585.mp4?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>MAJOR UPDATE: PvP MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new way to ruin friendships.<br>Pick an arena on the in-game computer and jump straight into the fight.<br>Set the rules by yourself: time limit, kill goal, infinite mode, gear spawn rate.<br>Weapons &amp; power-ups spawn on the map and then you lose them on death.<br>5 arenas to start: Volcano Crater, SOS Factory, Flight 747, Pyramid, Tower<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/14a219eda9ba9c3fd590bc95de74cadf.poster.avif?t=1791094099\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/14a219eda9ba9c3fd590bc95de74cadf.webm?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/14a219eda9ba9c3fd590bc95de74cadf.mp4?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You’re a team of emergency responders.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In practice, that means you’re <i>at least trying</i> to be one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone’s putting out a fire, someone’s carrying a cat, someone accidentally drops a teammate off a roof, and someone else has no idea what the objective is — but they’re doing their best. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/e31d59ed0bc09cbf765e4e790d61b40a.poster.avif?t=1791094099\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/e31d59ed0bc09cbf765e4e790d61b40a.webm?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/e31d59ed0bc09cbf765e4e790d61b40a.mp4?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Physics is the thing you’ll either love us for or absolutely hate us for.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It breaks plans, creates ridiculous situations, and turns even the simplest actions into a chain of failures, shouting (and sometimes… victories). </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/6f98213f813aad3ee0485ac53d0960a9.poster.avif?t=1791094099\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/6f98213f813aad3ee0485ac53d0960a9.webm?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>No boring tutorials. No tedious tasks.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was made by ADHD people, for ADHD people. Just fast-paced missions, constant movement, and a lot of falling over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/dc5cca9f78aaa8f59375abdd9f89f390.poster.avif?t=1791094099\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/dc5cca9f78aaa8f59375abdd9f89f390.webm?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/dc5cca9f78aaa8f59375abdd9f89f390.mp4?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Grab a team of up to 4 players and dive into the city chaos, where success isn’t measured by completed levels — but by how loud you’re laughing.<strong> </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/6e4fe3c1d3b989ab9e7d2947460da206.poster.avif?t=1791094099\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/6e4fe3c1d3b989ab9e7d2947460da206.webm?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475460/extras/6e4fe3c1d3b989ab9e7d2947460da206.mp4?t=1791094099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/8.1/10/11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-10100F or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":[],"developers":["ArtDock"],"publishers":["Dreland Enterprises"],"release_date":"Nov 30, 2023"}